WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.767
Place the context before inference. Its content changes between requests.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:09.524
Add inference: the model uses its learned parameters to predict the next token.

00:00:09.524 --> 00:00:14.530
Complete the path from context to inference to the next token.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:19.375
Arrange the three concepts in reading order.

00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:24.212
Connect context to inference. The arrow means input to the model, not retraining.

00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:29.136
Connect inference to the next token. Generation appends that token and repeats.

00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:37.510
Check sections 1.2 and 1.7: prompt and context feed inference with fixed weights, followed by next-token generation.
